Art-only: appends 341 crossed-card tufts (existing foliage atlas) into
env_sky_static_foliage_cards and 52 low-poly stones (existing palette cells)
into env_sky_static_palette inside env_skycity.glb. No new texture, material,
mesh, node or meta sub-asset; other 52 GLB bufferViews byte-identical.
Scatter excludes the 09 board-background frustum (min NDC 4.8) and 1 m around
the Build05 route. Does not touch RegionJourneyAdapter.ts / RegionJourneyCore.ts.
